CH₃COOH + OH⁻ → CH₃COO⁻ + H₂O  
0.050 mol CH₃COOH reacts with 0.050 mol OH⁻, leaving 0.100 - 0.050 = 0.050 mol OH⁻ excess.  
Also produces 0.050 mol CH₃COO⁻.

**Step 3: Final solution composition.**

Total volume = 0.500 + 0.400 + 0.300 = 1.200 L.  
